            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(47,110,99,0.05)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', borderLeft: '4px solid #2F6E63' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC","Noto Sans SC",sans-serif', fontSize: 15, color: '#26302C', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2F6E63' }}>查不到就直说查不到</span>——我们专门用「陷阱题」考过它。
